#: books/il_notes_4.txt:38
msgid "The Chamber finally gave their response. They did send a few mages, but not nearly enough. There's a promise of a larger gold share when the excavation is complete. Somehow, I don't think Empyrean politics will allow such a thing to manifest."
msgstr ""

#: books/il_notes_7.txt:38
msgid "The Chamber sees the situation differently. Orders came in for operations to be moved to other nearby sites. Krolan obeyed. Said he didn't want end up dead like \"those guys\". As if our guys are dead! When I find them, we're going to snag the rest of that Mastite for ourselves!"
msgstr ""

#: items/categories/level_12_unique.txt:6
msgid "The ancient scripture contained appears to be some sort of magic."
msgstr ""

#: books/il_notes_1.txt:19
msgid "The dig near Perdition Harbor is starting to show promise. We found ruins. Unlike anything else in the area. We'll get a good amount of gold from the relics here. A welcome change for the guys that transferred from the Empyrean's operation in the complex under Lochport."
msgstr ""

#: books/wardens_notes_2.txt:18
msgid "The entertainment didn't last long. The subject immediately went south."
msgstr ""

#: books/il_notes_2.txt:38
msgid "The messenger to the Chamber called the mineral \"Mastite\". It was made clear that any we find must be brought to the surface. No questions. This stuff is obviously something special. They better make it worth our while."
msgstr ""

#: books/wardens_notes_2.txt:13
msgid "The other subjects had been very eager, so I invited a few to watch today's challenger."
msgstr ""

#: books/il_notes_3.txt:19
msgid "There's more to this whole Mastite thing than we're being told. Yesterday, one of the crew was about to grab a chunk he had found. In the blink of an eye, some sort of energy ball flew out of it and blasted the poor guy back about 100 paces."
msgstr ""

#: items/categories/level_4_unique.txt:37
msgid "These hands built a village."
msgstr ""

#: items/categories/level_4_unique.txt:85
msgid "These ragged trousers are covered in scorch marks, yet are cold to the touch."
msgstr ""

#: books/il_notes_5.txt:19
msgid "These ruins are larger than we had imagined. There must be other connections to the surface. Krolan found a portal today, but no one dared to enter."
msgstr ""

#: books/il_notes_1.txt:32
msgid "They told me about the other expeditions, a tower in Black Oak City and a temple in the Stormrock region. Both just as fruitless."
msgstr ""

